# The gems this stack is built with come from the feed this stack provisions.
# That circularity is deliberate and only bites in one situation: if the feed is
# broken, temporarily point this at another source to deploy the fix. Pinned
# exactly, because infrastructure should redeploy identically until someone
# decides otherwise.
